==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|werfen|wërfen|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|werfan|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{recons|werpaną|lang=gem-pro}}. Cognate with Old Saxon {{term|werpan|lang=osx}}, Dutch {{term|werpen|lang=nl}}, English {{term|warp|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈvɛʁfən/|[ˈvɛɐ̯fɱ̩]|[ˈvɛɐ̯fən]|[ˈvɛʁfɱ̩]|[ˈvɛʁfən]|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-werfen.ogg|audio}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb-strong|class=3|wirft|warf|geworfen|past subjunctive=würfe}}

# {{context|transitive|intransitive|or|reflexive}} To [[throw]].
# {{context|transitive|computing|[[exception]] handling|lang=de}} To [[throw]]
#: ''Der Konstruktor mit dem einen Parameter '''wirft''' in diesem Falle eine Ausnahme.''
#:: ''The constructor with this one parameter '''throws''' in this case an exception.''
# {{context|transitive}} To [[cast]]
#: {{usex|einen Schatten '''werfen'''|t=to cast a shadow|lang=de|inline=1}}

